        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Garth Jennings, Lee Cheol-ha, Nick Goldsmith\n- Organizations: Hammer & Tongs\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, producer, actor\n- Places: Britain, South Korea\n\nFacts:\n- Garth Jennings was born in 1972 and is a British film director, screenwriter, producer, and actor.\n- Lee Cheol-ha is a South Korean film director known for stylish portraits of the human experience.\n- Hammer & Tongs is the pseudonym of British director and producer duo Garth Jennings and Nick Goldsmith.\n- Hammer & Tongs is also the name of the production company associated with Garth Jennings and Nick Goldsmith.",
